# THE THIRTEEN DIVERGENCES, ATTRIBUTED. MEASURED 2026-11-06 BY
# `.agents/slop/sym92/attribute.py`, WHICH IS THE INSTRUMENT: THE PORT's `sym_f` AGAINST
