r295	UPSTREAM REWRITES AND THE PORT DECLINES	THE PORT LACKS UPSTREAM's **TWO-STAGE ALU FOLDING** (`:171`-`:173`, SIX ROWS: MUL MAX XOR OR AND ADD). UPSTREAM GETS `(add y (add x c1))` TO `(add (add x y) 1)` IN TWO STEPS AND THE PORT HAS ONLY THE SECOND (`:309`, WHICH IS THE PORT's `sym_295`).
r296	UPSTREAM REWRITES AND THE PORT DECLINES	THE SAME MISSING TWO-STAGE ALU FOLDING.
